The components in this folder are Cupric re-implementations of ideas from
ObsidianUI (https://gitlab.com/Atharvsinh-codez/ObsidianUI). They are rewritten
to be pure functions of the stage clock (no requestAnimationFrame, no wall
clock, no pointer events), so preview, recording and export are identical.
The formulas they keep (FlipText's sine stagger, ClickSpark's burst geometry)
come from ObsidianUI, which is distributed under this licence:

